ng  Lobby casting its political net just to  get back in the market it's not like  we're dying because of lack of fishing  revenues we more than can make up for it  but whatever happens he says at least  the debate has focused attention on  Palau which for Generations has been  doing more to protect the world's oceans  than countries thousands of times its  size we're happy that people take notice  of what Palau is doing but that's the  idea take notice and do something  for CBS mornings I'm Lee Cowan in Palau
 

